    "custom_faq_afKPpE": {
      "type": "custom-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_73nVbP": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q1. What Is HolistIQ?",
            "answer": "<p>HolistIQ is a <strong>clean-label nutrition drink for growing children (2+ years)</strong> designed to support <strong>growth, brain development, digestion, immunity, and daily nutrition</strong>. Unlike conventional kids’ drinks, it combines <strong>high-quality proteins, prebiotic fibres, DHA, digestive enzymes, vitamins, and minerals</strong>—without unnecessary fillers or junk ingredients.</p>",
            "open_by_default": true
          }
        },
        "faq_FRkPep": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q2. What makes HolistIQ different?",
            "answer": "<p>HolistIQ is built around<strong>clean nutrition with functional ingredients</strong>. It uses<strong>Whey Protein Isolate + milk proteins</strong>for balanced protein support, provides<strong>13 g prebiotic fibre (FOS)</strong>and<strong>11.7 g total dietary fibre per 100 g</strong>for gut health, includes<strong>DHA and brain-supporting nutrients</strong>, and uses<strong>only 10% added unrefined sugar</strong>.<br/><br/>It is also formulated<strong>without maltodextrin, refined sugar, artificial sweeteners, emulsifiers, preservatives, vegetable oils, or artificial flavours and colours.</strong></p>",
            "open_by_default": true
          }
        },
        "faq_fWtdqt": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q3. How does it support brain development?",
            "answer": "<p>HolistIQ includes nutrients that play important roles in <strong>brain growth and cognitive development</strong>, including:</p><ul><li><strong>DHA (100 mg per 100 g)</strong> for brain structure and neuronal function<br/></li><li><strong>Iron (4.5 mg)</strong> and <strong>Iodine (110 mcg)</strong> to support learning and cognitive development<br/></li><li><strong>B-vitamins (B6, B9, B12)</strong> and <strong>Choline (80 mg)</strong> to support nervous system function and brain health<br/></li></ul><p>These nutrients work together to support children during important developmental years.</p>",
            "open_by_default": true
          }
        },
        "faq_Q9dpNx": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q4. Does it support gut health?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. HolistIQ is designed with a <strong>gut-first approach to nutrition</strong>.</p><p>It contains <strong>13 g Fructooligosaccharides (FOS)</strong>, a prebiotic fibre that helps support beneficial gut bacteria, along with <strong>11.7 g dietary fibre</strong> and <strong>protease enzyme (75 mg)</strong> to support protein digestion.</p><p>This combination helps support <strong>digestion, nutrient absorption, and tummy comfort</strong>.</p>",
            "open_by_default": true
          }
        },
        "faq_dAKPy6": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q5. Is it good for height and growth?",
            "answer": "<p>HolistIQ is formulated to support healthy growth by combining <strong>high-quality protein with growth-supporting micronutrients</strong>.</p><p>Per 100 g, it provides:</p><ul><li><strong>26.67 g protein</strong><br/></li><li><strong>400 mg calcium</strong><br/></li><li><strong>125 mg magnesium</strong><br/></li><li><strong>250 mg phosphorus</strong><br/></li><li><strong>Vitamin D3 (37.5 mcg)</strong> and <strong>Vitamin K2-7 (55 mcg)</strong><br/></li></ul><p>These nutrients help support <strong>bone development, muscle growth, and overall physical development during growing years</strong>.</p>",
            "open_by_default": true
          }
        },
        "faq_ra3Rmp": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q6. Does it contain refined sugar or artificial sweeteners?",
            "answer": "<p>No. HolistIQ contains <strong>no refined sugar and no artificial sweeteners</strong>.</p><p>It is formulated with <strong>only 10% added unrefined brown sugar</strong> and uses <strong>monk fruit</strong> for sweetness support, helping provide taste without excessive sugar.</p>",
            "open_by_default": true
          }
        },
        "faq_LfYPYW": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q7. Are there any junk ingredients?",
            "answer": "<p>No. HolistIQ is formulated without commonly used filler ingredients.</p><p>It contains <strong>NO:</strong></p><ul><li>Maltodextrin</li><li>Refined sugar</li><li>Artificial colours or flavours</li><li>Emulsifiers</li><li>Vegetable / seed oils</li><li>Preservatives</li><li>Sugar alcohols</li><li>Artificial sweeteners</li></ul><p>The focus is on <strong>clean ingredients with functional nutritional value</strong>.</p>",
            "open_by_default": true
          }
        },
        "faq_xPDaHq": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q8. Can it replace a meal?",
            "answer": "<p>HolistIQ is designed as a <strong>nutrition supplement and not a complete meal replacement</strong>.</p><p>It can be used as part of breakfast, an evening drink, or alongside meals to help improve overall nutrient intake, but children should continue eating a balanced diet with whole foods.</p>",
            "open_by_default": true
          }
        },
        "faq_kQM34B": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q9. Is it safe for daily use?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. HolistIQ is designed for <strong>regular daily consumption for children aged 2 years and above</strong>.</p><p>It provides a balanced combination of <strong>proteins, fibres, vitamins, minerals, DHA, and digestive support ingredients</strong>, making it suitable as part of everyday nutrition.</p><p>Use as per recommended serving instructions.</p>",
            "open_by_default": true
          }
        },
        "faq_iVjWqt": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q10. Are There Any Allergens?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. HolistIQ contains <strong>milk-derived ingredients</strong>, including:</p><ul><li>Whole Milk Powder</li><li>Skimmed Milk Powder</li><li>Whey Protein Isolate</li></ul><p>Children with <strong>milk allergy, dairy sensitivity, or specific dietary restrictions</strong> should consult a healthcare professional before use.</p>",
            "open_by_default": true
          }
        }
      },
